  "description": "Proposal to demolish and replace the existing porch with a new porch of a larger footprint that is in keeping with its historic character. The new porch will accommodate an accessible WC, as the church currently lacks any toilet facilities.\nThe proposed works also include path improvements, such as changes to materials, regrading, the addition of a handrail to the steep lower section, new and revised seating, and new external lighting.\n",
